      "id": "claim_54e1bff5aa954736bb4b509e16e916b1",
      "statement": "The CBO Status Projection Service (SPS, system ID SYS-CBO-SPS) is a Kafka-consumer-to-Postgres-read-model system exposing /cbo/sps/v1, built under story CBO-3815 as the platform half of the ACH Payment Tracker epic (CBO-3790), and is named as the reference implementation of ADR-PAY-019's event-driven, non-polling channel status requirement.",
