    {
      "id": "claim_ceeb0fd80e304b708b9e08302a03dbee",
      "statement": "As of the CBO-ARCH-WC-4.1 architecture review (last reviewed 2026-08-20), SPS is configured for ACH only; it has no subscription to pay.wire.lifecycle.v2 and Wire Center does not call /cbo/sps/v1, instead still deriving status from synchronous, throttled PPH v1 calls.",
