    {
      "id": "claim_d69b34035ed24d398f270245989e0f14",
      "statement": "SPS was built alongside the reusable, rail-agnostic <cbo-journey-timeline> Aurora Design System component (CBO-3802) under the same CBO-3790 epic, and both are catalogued in CBO-ARCH-WC-4.1 as reusable assets for extending client-facing status to any payment type, including wires, via configuration plus a per-rail mapping module.",
