    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2cf87f99e1914d6293f305d8cb079ce8",
      "statement": "Even if a wire mapping module were built, SPS's wire projection would inherit two content limits from the underlying pay.wire.lifecycle.v2 topic: hold reason codes/descriptions can never be surfaced (per ADR-PAY-021, hold detail stays within Financial Crimes Trust systems; only hold presence and holdId are available), and ISO pacs.004 return reasons have only been published on the topic since PPH-2266 shipped in 2026-08.",
