      "statement": "SPS is owned by the CBO Platform & Entitlements team (distinct from the CBO Wire Center squad) and runs at T2 (business-hours plus on-call) support, meaning any future wire-tracking integration with SPS would be a cross-team build rather than a Wire-Center-only change.",
